# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Face ID & Blockchain Verification Pipeline — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your API keys.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Step 2: SerpAPI (Reverse Image Search via Google Lens) ──────────────────
# Get your free key at https://serpapi.com  (100 searches/month on free tier)
SERPAPI_KEY=your_serpapi_key_here

# ── Step 3/4: Ethereum Sepolia Testnet ──────────────────────────────────────
# Option A: Infura Project ID (preferred)
#   1. Create account at https://infura.io
#   2. Create a new project → copy the Project ID
INFURA_PROJECT_ID=your_infura_project_id_here

# Option B: Full RPC URL (use this OR INFURA_PROJECT_ID, not both)
#   Uncomment and set if you use Alchemy or another RPC provider
# ETH_RPC_URL=https://sepolia.infura.io/v3/your_project_id

# ── Ethereum Wallet ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Use a SEPOLIA TESTNET wallet — never use a mainnet wallet with real funds.
# Export private key from MetaMask: Account → ⋯ → Account Details → Export Private Key
ETH_PRIVATE_KEY=your_eth_private_key_here

# Your wallet's public address (0x...)
ETH_WALLET_ADDRESS=your_eth_wallet_address_here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTES:
#   • You need Sepolia ETH (free) to pay gas fees.
#     Get some at: https://sepoliafaucet.com or https://faucets.chain.link/sepolia
#   • The .env file is in .gitignore — never commit your real keys.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
